[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: global namespace script (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mNew session.js loaded before app.js, exposes window.AppSession. No build step, page still opens from disk, future [39m
     [38;5;246mforms add one script tag.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: ES modules
     [38;5;246mReal module boundaries via <script type="module">. Requires serving the page over HTTP; file:// stops working.[39m
